<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.4">
  <office:styles>
    <style:default-style style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:line-height="100%" fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt"/>
    </style:default-style>
    <style:style style:name="Cell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.06cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Bold" style:family="text">
      <style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Center" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Small" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="8pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="PageBreak" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="page"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
    <style:page-layout style:name="PageLayout">
      <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="21cm" fo:page-height="29.7cm" fo:margin-top="1.5cm" fo:margin-bottom="1.5cm" fo:margin-left="1.5cm" fo:margin-right="1.5cm" style:print-orientation="portrait"/>
    </style:page-layout>
    <style:style style:name="T" style:family="table">
      <style:table-properties style:width="18cm" table:align="center" table:border-model="collapsing"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C1" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.5cm"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C2" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="4.8cm"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C3" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.8cm"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C4" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.2cm"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C5" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.8cm"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C6" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="6.9cm"/></style:style>
  </office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles>
    <style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="PageLayout"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">避難者カード【中国語（簡体</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">避難者卡（正面）</text:span>　【様式－７】</text:p>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="Bold">填写日</text:span>　　年　　月　　日　　 请每个家庭都填写一张。</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Front" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>避難日期</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>年　月　日　点左右</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>避難场所</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>避難所　・　居家　・　其他　（　）</text:p><text:p>※在车内住宿避難者请填写停车场的位置。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>自治会名</text:p><text:p>※如果未加入自治会，写上“未加入”</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>在避難所的人打圈</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">片假名读音</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">姓 名</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">年龄</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">性別</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">关系</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>备注※需要照顾者号码以及需要照顾的地方</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>（代表者）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　　岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　　岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　　岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　　岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　　岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>〒</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>代表者电话号码</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>（　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>有无宠物</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>有　　・　　无　　 ※选「有」的，请接着填写宠物登记票。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>需照顾者</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>1 孕产妇　　2 婴幼儿　　3 残疾人（</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
      <table:table table:name="CareContinuation" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>※请在备注栏填写所属号码</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>4 需要护理　　5 使用医疗机械（　）</text:p><text:p>6 过敏症（　　　　　　）　　7 外国人（国籍　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>8 其他（　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>※需照顾者指孕产妇、婴幼儿、残疾人等在避難生活中需要特别照顾的人士。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">避難者卡（背面）</text:span>　【様式－７】</text:p>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="Bold">背面内容可等状况安定后再填写。</text:span></text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Back" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>为了确认安否而公开信息（请选择「希望」「不希望」的任意一个，并打○。）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>您同意通过网页或报道机构等公开避難者（您的）信息吗？</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>当亲戚、同个住处的人、朋友问及您的安否时，您同意提供避難者（您的）信息吗？</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="3" table:number-columns-spanned="1"><text:p>房屋受灾状况</text:p><text:p>※请在该当的选项上画圈。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>有　　・　　无　 ※选“有”后，请详细填写住房受害状况。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>※填写例</text:p><text:p>・房子倒塌，近期内无法居住。</text:p><text:p>・室内收拾好后，可以回去居住。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>停电　　　　停水　　　　煤气断了　　　　电话不通</text:p><text:p>其他（　　　　　　　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>伤病者信息</text:p><text:p>请填写姓名和具体的负伤、疾病状况。</text:p><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>收容场所</text:p><text:p>（送往机构）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>收容场所信息</text:p><text:p>（送往机构地址）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>特記事项（如果有有种资格等，可以提供合作的人士，请填写姓名和内容。）</text:p><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">＜避難所运营委员会填写栏＞</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="ShelterCommittee" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>退所年月日</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
      <table:table table:name="Departure" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>退出后去向</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>电话</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>为确保避難所的顺利运作，敬请各位避難人员（包括居家避難及车内避難人员）在力所能及的范围内协助参与避難所的管理与运营。</text:p>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>